# not clear an aborted PostgreSQL transaction. In provision_owner the next
# statement failed with "current transaction is aborted"; in
# grant_employee_owner the next statement was conn.commit(), which PostgreSQL
# converts to a ROLLBACK and reports as success, so a minted owner was discarded
# silently while the caller reported the grant applied. Both are now behind
# savepoints.

